s="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Madaniy meros agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 237px"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 579px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 579px" valign="top" width="29%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Konsert-tomosha faoliyatini amalga oshirish uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 237px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Yakkaxon ijrochi konserti (bitta ijrochining yakkaxon konsert dasturi), bitta janrning ikki yoki undan koʻp ijrochisi ishtirokidagi konsert dasturi, turli janrlar yoʻnalishlarining bir nechta ijrochisi ishtirokidagi konsert dasturi (yakkaxon xonanda, sozanda, raqqosa, boshlovchi, qiziqchi va boshqalar), ommaviy axborot vositalarida qoʻshiqlar va videokliplarni taqdim etish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 579px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Madaniyat vazirligi huzuridagi </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">“<span style="color: black">Oʻzbekkonsert</span>”<span style="color: black"> davlat muassasasi</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 342px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 342px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">restoranlar, barlar, qahvaxonalar, xususiy uylarda yubiley tantanalarida xizmat koʻrsatish, restoranlar, barlar, qahvaxonalar va xususiy uylarda toʻylarda (FHDYdagi marosim, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">“<span style="color: black">osh berish</span>” marosimi<span style="color: black">, kechqurungi nikoh tuzish — </span>“<span style="color: black">nikoh toʻyi</span>” marosimi<span style="color: black">, </span>“<span style="color: black">kelin salom</span>” marosimi<span style="color: black">), </span>“<span style="color: black">sunnat toʻyi</span>”<span style="color: black"> marosimiga xizmat koʻrsatish, koʻngilochar tashkilotlarda — klublar, diskotekalar, restoranlar, barlar va qahvaxonalarda xizmat koʻrsatish (yakkaxon xonanda, sozanda, raqqosa, boshlovchi, qiziqchi, didjey-ovoz operatori, maʼmur va boshqalar).</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 180px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 180px" valign="top" width="29%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Advokatlik faoliyati uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Fuqarolik va iqtisodiy sud ishlarini yu