"42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Sugʻurtalovchilarning (qayta sugʻurtalovchilarning) sugʻurta faoliyati;</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 138px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Istiqbolli loyihalar milliy agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 69px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">sugʻurta brokerlarining sugʻurta faoliyati.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 132px"><td rowspan="8" style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 741px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">9.</span></p></td><td rowspan="8" style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 741px" valign="top" width="29%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Isteʼmol va texnik etil spirti, alkogol mahsulotlari ishlab chiqarish uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 132px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Rektifikatlangan isteʼmol etil spirtini, shu jumladan uzum, rezavor meva, shuningdek vino spirtini, uzum va rezavor mevadan tayyorlangan spirt xom ashyosini ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="8" style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 741px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Bosh prokuraturasi huzuridagi Iqtisodiy jinoyatlarga qarshi kurashish departamenti qoshidagi Alkogol va tamaki bozorini tartibga solish inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 111px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 111px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">texnik etil spirtini, efiroaldegidli fraksiyani (etil spirtining bosh fraksiyasini) ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">uzum, vino, konyak, viski, rom, rezavor meva va kalvados distillyatini ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">aroq, shu jumladan uzum va meva arogʻini, shuningdek likyor-aroq mahsulotlarini ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 69px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">konyak, konyak ichimligini, brendi, viski, rom, kalvadosni ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">uzum va rezavor meva vinosini, koʻpiklanadigan va gazli vinoni ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">oʻtkirligi 7,0 foizdan 22 foizgacha boʻlgan vino ichimliklarini ishlab chiqarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 69px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">uzum va rezavor mevadan tayyorlangan vino materiallarini ishlab chiqarish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 279px"><td style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">10.</span></p></td><td style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="29%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Alkogol mahsulotlarining ulgurji savdosi (bundan tabiiy va koʻpiklanadigan vinolar, pivo va pivo ichimliklari mustasno) boʻyicha faoliyat uchun litsenziya </span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Alkogol mahsulotlarining ulgurji savdosi. </span></p></td><td style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Bosh prokuraturasi huzuridagi Iqtisodiy jinoyatlarga qarshi kurashish departamenti qoshidagi Alkogol va tamaki bozorini tartibga solish inspeksiyasi </span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 279px"><td style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">11.</span></p></td><td style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="29%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Tamaki mahsulotlari ishlab chiqarish faoliyati uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Tamaki mahsulotlarini (barcha klassdagi sigaretlar, papiroslar, sigaralar va sigarillalarni) sanoat asosida ishlab chiqarish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Bosh prokuraturasi huzuridagi Iqtisodiy jinoyatlarga qarshi kurashish departamenti qoshidagi Alkogol va tamaki bozorini tartibga solish inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 216px"><td rowspan="7" style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 1281px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">12.</span></p></td><td rowspan="7" style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 1281px" valign="top" width="29%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Affinaj faoliyati uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 216px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ikkilamchi resurslar, parcha va chiqindilardagi qimmatbaho metallarni, shu jumladan oltin izlovchilar usulida qazib olingan qimmatbaho metallarni affinaj qilish, shuningdek mexanik, kimyoviy va metallurgiya jarayonlaridan foydalangan holda oʻz ishlab chiqarish chiqindilaridan qimmatbaho metallarni ajratib olish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="7" style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 1281px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Davlat asillik darajasi nazorati inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 279px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 279px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">foydali qazilmalarni qazib olish uchun yer qaʼri uchastkalaridan foydalanish huquqini beruvchi litseziyaga ega boʻlganlar uchun — tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan mineral xom-ashyoni qazib olish, qayta ishlash, tashish, shixtovkalash, tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan konsentratlarni, gravitatsiya konsentratlarini, choʻkindi oltinni, Dore qotishmasini, katod metallarni, rux choʻkmalarini, boyitilgan smolani olish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 153px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 153px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan ikkilamchi resurslarni, parcha va chiqindilarni toʻplash, tashish, qismlarga ajratish, ularga dastlabki ishlov berish, ularni saralash, qayta ishlash hamda utilizatsiya qilish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 237px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 237px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">yuridik va jismoniy shaxslardan qimmatbaho metallarni, shu jumladan oltin izlovchilar usulida qazib olingan qimmatbaho metallarni, zargarlik buyumlarini, qimmatbaho metallarning parcha va chiqindilarini, ikkilamchi resurslarni, ishlab chiqarish-texnik yoʻnalishdagi va tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan boshqa buyumlarni sotib olish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 216px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 216px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">oltin izlovchilarga xizmatlar koʻrsatish, tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan ikkilamchi resurslar, parchalar va chiqindilarni toʻplash uchun sotib olingan qimmatbaho metallarning but saqlanishini taʼminlashga doir talablarga muvofiq jihozlangan sayyor qabul qilish-tayyorlov punktlarini tashkil etish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">respublika hududida qimmatbaho metallarni sotib olish va sotish punktlarini ochish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallarni sotib olish va sotish boʻyicha birja savdolarida ishtirok etish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 48px"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 96px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">13.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 29.7823%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0