: RU">Arxitektura-shaharsozlik hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish faoliyati uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 111px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi hududini va hududi qismlarini rivojlantirishni rejalashtirish toʻgʻrisidagi hujjatlarni ishlab chiqish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="21" style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 2184px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Qurilish va uy-joy kommunal xoʻjaligi vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU"> aholi punktlari hududlarini qurish va rivojlantirish toʻgʻrisidagi hujjatlarni ishlab chiqish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 111px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 111px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">qurilish obyektlari uchun muhandislik-texnik qidiruvlarini (muhandislik-geodeziya qidiruvlaridan tashqari) bajarish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 153px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 153px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">uy-joy-xoʻjalik qurilishi uchun obyektlar va komplekslar loyiha-smeta hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish, shu jumladan ularning muhandislik tarmoqlari va tizimlarini loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 132px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 132px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">sanoat qurilishi uchun obyektlar va komplekslar loyiha-smeta hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish, shu jumladan ularning muhandislik tarmoqlari va tizimlarini loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 153px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 153px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">suv xoʻjaligi qurilishi uchun obyektlar va komplekslar loyiha-smeta hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish, shu jumladan ularning muhandislik tarmoqlari va tizimlarini loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 153px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 153px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">qishloq xoʻjaligi qurilishi uchun obyektlar va komplekslar loyiha-smeta hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish, shu jumladan ularning muhandislik tarmoqlari va tizimlarini loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 132px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 132px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">energetika qurilishi va aloqa obyektlari hamda komplekslarini loyihalashtirish, shu jumladan ularning muhandislik tarmoqlari va tizimlarini loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 132px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 132px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">transport va yoʻl qurilishi obyektlari hamda komplekslarini loyihalashtirish, shu jumladan ularning muhandislik tarmoqlari va tizimlarini loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 111px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 111px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">magistral muhandislik tarmoqlarini (magistral gaz quvurlari, neft quvurlari va neft mahsulotlari quvurlaridan tashqari) loyihalashtirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 111px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 111px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">umumiy foydalaniladigan avtomobil yoʻllarini qurish, rekonstruksiya qilish va taʼmirlash uchun loyiha-smeta hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 69px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">arxitektura yodgorliklarini taʼmirlash uchun hujjatlar;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">“Obyektlarning asoslari va poydevorlari</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">”<span style="color: black"> boʻlimini loyihalashtirish;</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 69px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 69px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">“Metall obyektlar konstruksiyalari</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">”<span style="color: black"> boʻlimini loyihalashtirish;</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 90px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 90px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"