rgin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Qurol-yarogʻ va uning oʻq-dorilarini, himoya vositalarini, harbiy texnikani, ularning ehtiyot qismlari, butlovchi qismlari va priborlarini, agar ulardan boshqa tarmoqlarda foydalanilmasa, shuningdek ularni ishlab chiqarish uchun maxsus materiallarni va maxsus asbob-uskunani yaratish, ishlab chiqarish, taʼmirlash va realizatsiya qilish sohasidagi faoliyat uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 195px" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 16.35pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Qurol-yarogʻ va uning oʻq-dorilarini, himoya vositalarini, harbiy texnikani, ularning ehtiyot qismlari, butlovchi qismlari va priborlarini, agar ulardan boshqa tarmoqlarda foydalanilmasa, shuningdek ularni ishlab chiqarish uchun maxsus materiallarni va maxsus asbob-uskunani yaratish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="4" style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 780px" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Mudofaa vazirligi huzuridagi Mudofaa sanoati agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 195px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left