">Internet jahon axborot tarmogʻida tavakkalchilikka asoslangan oʻyinlarni tashkil etish faoliyati.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 401px"><td colspan="4" style="width: 99.8584%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 5.65pt;height: 401px" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;line-height: normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Izoh</span></span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">: Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Istiqbolli loyihalar milliy agentligi belgilangan tartibda:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;line-height: normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">a) tavakkalchilikka asoslangan oʻyinlarga qaramligi boʻlgan shaxslar roʻyxatini yuritadi.</span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;line-height: normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Tavakkalchilikka asoslangan oʻyinlarga qaramligi boʻlgan shaxslar roʻyxatiga jismoniy shaxslar quyidagi muddatlarga kiritiladi:</span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;line-height: normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">6 oydan 5 yilgacha muddatga — tavakkalchilikka asoslangan oʻyinlarga qaramligi boʻlgan jismoniy shaxsning arizasi asosida;</span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;line-height: normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">5 yil muddatga — tavakkalchilikka asoslangan oʻyinlarga qaramligi boʻlgan jismoniy shaxs yaqin qarindoshlarining arizasi asosida sud qaroriga koʻra;</span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;line-height: normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">b) Internet jahon axborot tarmogʻida tavakkalchilikka asoslangan oʻyinlar, lotereyalar va bukmekerlik faoliyati tashkilotchilari tomonidan lotereyalar va tavakkalchilikka asoslangan boshqa oʻyinlar toʻgʻrisidagi qonunchilik, shu jumladan jinoiy faoliyatdan olingan daromadlarni legallashtirishga, terrorizmni moliyalashtirishga va ommaviy qirgʻin qurolini tarqatishni moliyalashtirishga qarshi kurashish toʻgʻrisidagi qonunchilik buzilganligi uchun qonunchilik hujjatlarida nazarda tutilgan miqdorlarda jarima soladi.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 53.75px"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.13057%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 131px" valign="top" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">47.</span