iyatni amalga oshirish uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 179px" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 18.8pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasidan olib chiqilayotgan karantin ostidagi mahsulotning fumigatsiyasi boʻyicha faoliyat.</span></p></td><td style="width: 22.149%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm;height: 179px" width="22%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Qishloq xoʻjaligi vazirligi huzuridagi Oʻsimliklar karantini va himoyasi agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 111px"><td rowspan="2" style="border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-left: 1pt solid windowtext;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm;width: 5.13057%;height: 201px"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">61.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm;width: 29.7823%;height: 201px"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-marg