solid windowtext;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm;width: 5.13057%;height: 144px"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> 62. </span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm;width: 29.7823%;height: 144px"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;margin-left: 3.65pt;text-indent: 21.8pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Qora metall parcha va chiqindilarini tayyorlash (xarid qilish), qayta ishlash hamda realizatsiya qilish boʻyicha faoliyatni amalga oshirish uchun litsenziya </span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;margin-left: 3.65pt;text-indent: 21.8pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> </span></p></td><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 48px"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 18.8pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Qora metall parcha va chiqindilarini tayyorlash (xarid qilish); </span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm;width: 22.149%;height: 144px"><p style="text-align: center">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Togʻ-kon sanoati va geologiya vazirligi</p><p style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 48px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 48px"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 18.8pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU"> qora metall parcha va chiqindilarini qayta ishlash;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 48px"><td style="width: 42.7964%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;padding: 0cm 3pt;height: 48px"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 18.8pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU"> qora metall parcha va chiqindilarini realizatsiya qilish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 48px"><td rowspan="3" style="border-right: 1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom: 1pt solid windowtext;border-left: 1pt solid windowtext;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm;width: 5.13057%;height: 144px"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, serif"><span style="font-size: 16px"><em>63.</em></span></span></p><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: U