Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Tovarlar (ishlar, xizmatlar) importi.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 10.5pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi “Loyihalar va import kontraktlarini kompleks ekspertiza qilish markazi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 26;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">26.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Madaniy boyliklarni Oʻzbekiston Respublikasidan olib chiqish yoki vaqtincha olib chiqish h