-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">49.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Sugʻurtalovchini (qayta sugʻurtalovchini) qayta tashkil etishga doir ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Sugʻurtalovchini (qayta sugʻurtalovchini) qayta tashkil etish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Istiqbolli loyihalar milliy agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 56;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">51.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Sanoat uchun ahamiyatini yoʻqotgan yoki keyinchalik oʻtkazilgan geologiya-qidiruv ishlarida yoxud konni ishga solishda tasdiqlanmagan foydali qazilma zaxiralarini yer osti boyliklaridan foydalanuvchining hisobidan chiqarish toʻgʻrisida qaror</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Sanoat uchun ahamiyatini yoʻqotgan yoki keyinchalik oʻtkazilgan geologiya-qidiruv ishlarida yoxud konni ishga solishda tasdiqlanmagan foydali qazilma zaxiralarini yer osti boyliklaridan foydalanuvchining hisobidan chiqarish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Togʻ-kon sanoati va geologiya vazirligi huzuridagi Foydali qazilmalar zaxiralari boʻyicha davlat komissiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 57;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">52.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Yer qaʼri toʻgʻrisidagi geologik materiallarda nazarda tutilgan foydali qazilmalar zaxiralarini tasdiqlash toʻgʻrisida qaror</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Yer qaʼri uchastkalaridan foydalanish huquqi uchun ruxsatnoma olish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Togʻ-kon sanoati va geologiya vazirligi huzuridagi Foydali qazilmalar zaxiralari boʻyicha davlat komissiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 59;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">54.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Yer qaʼri uchastkalaridan foydalanish huquqi uchun ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Yer qaʼri uchastkasidan geologik jihatdan oʻrganish; tajriba-sanoat yoʻsinida foydali qazilmalarni kavlab olish; oltin izlovchilar usulida qimmatbaho metallarni kavlab olish; foydali qazilmalarni kavlab olish; texnogen mineral xosilalardan foydalanish; foydali qazilmalarni kavlab olish bilan bogʻliq boʻlmagan yer osti inshootlarini qurish hamda ulardan foydalanish; muhofaza etiladigan geologik obyektlarni barpo etish; nodir tosh xom ashyosi namunalarini, paleontologik qoldiqlarni va boshqa geologik kolleksiyabop materiallarni toʻplash.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Togʻ-kon sanoati va geologiya vazirligi, Ekologiya, atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilish va iqlim oʻzgarishi vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 60;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">55.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Yer qaʼri boʻyicha geologik materiallarga doir loyiha-smeta hujjatlarining davlat ekspertizasi xulosasi</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Foydali qazilmalar konlarini geologik oʻrganishdan oʻtkazish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Togʻ-kon sanoati va geologiya vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 61;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">56.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Foydali qazilmalarni qazib olish bilan bogʻliq yer qaʼrini geologik oʻrganish ishlarini hisobga olish</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Foydali qazilmalarni qazib olish uchun yer qaʼri uchastkalaridan foydalanish huquqiga doir ruxsatnoma egasi tomonidan yer qaʼrini geologik oʻrganish boʻyicha foydali qazilmalarni qazib olish bilan bogʻliq ishlarini amalga oshirish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Togʻ-kon sanoati va geologiya vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 62;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-