al"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Mayning faoliyatini amalga oshirish uchun ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Mayning faoliyatini amalga oshirish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Istiqbolli loyihalar milliy agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 126;mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;height: 3.0pt"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">123.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Davlat xaridlari elektron tizimi operatori faoliyatini amalga oshirish uchun ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="42%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Davlat xaridlarining subyektlariga davlat xaridlari elektron tizimlarida xarid qilish tartib-taomillarini amalga oshirish bilan bogʻliq xizmatlar koʻrsatish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="21%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3.72%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">124. </span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Yonish va portlash xavfi yuqori boʻlgan kimyoviy moddalarni (mahsulotlarni) saqlash uchun obyektning (omborning) yongʻin va sanoat xavfsizligi talablariga muvofiqligi toʻgʻrisida xulosa</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> yonish va portlash xavfi yuqori boʻlgan kimyoviy moddalarni (mahsulotlarni) saqlash.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Favqulodda vaziyatlar vazirligi </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3.72%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">125. </span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Obyektda nogironligi boʻlgan shaxslar uchun shaharsozlik normalari va qoidalarida belgilangan talablarga muvofiq qulay shart-sharoitlar yaratilganligi boʻyicha xulosa</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Nodavlat taʼlim xizmatlarini koʻrsatish sohasidagi faoliyat uchun litsenziya olish, bank faoliyatini amalga oshirish huquqini beruvchi litsenziya olish, kredit byurolari faoliyatini amalga oshirish uchun litsenziya olish, tibbiy faoliyat uchun litsenziya olish, farmatsevtika faoliyati uchun litsenziya olish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Mahkamasi huzuridagi Qurilish va uy-joy kommunal xoʻjaligi sohasida nazorat qilish inspeksiyasi </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3.72%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> 126.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Yoʻl obyektida qurilish va taʼmirlash ishlari uchun ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Yoʻl infratuzilmasi obyektlarida qurilish ishlarini olib borish, yoʻl obyektini har qanday koʻrinishda taʼmirlash, buzish, qazish, oʻzgartirish yoki rekonstruksiya qilish ishlarini amalga oshirish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Yoʻl obyektini balansida saqlovchi tashkilotlar, kommunikatsiya tarmoqlaridagi avariya bilan bogʻliq yoki boshqa kechiktirib boʻlmaydigan hollarda esa tuman (shahar) hokimligi </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3.72%;border-right: 1pt solid black;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-left: 1pt solid black;border-image: initial;border-top: none;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> 127.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.44%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 12.6pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Qurilishi tugallangan yoʻl obyektidan foydalanish uchun ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 42.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 17.3pt;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Avtomobil yoʻllari va sunʼiy inshootlar qurilishi va rekonstruksiyasi tugallangan yoʻl obyektidan foydalanish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 21.2%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">Transport vazirligi huzuridagi Transport nazorati inspeksiyasining hududiy boʻlinmalari </span></p></td></tr></thead></table></div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="-8109728" id="-8109728">(2-ilova Oʻzbekiston Respublikasining 2026-yil 25-martdagi <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/-8099232?ONDATE=28.06.2026 00#-8100620">OʻRQ-1124-sonli</a>, 2026-yil 19-maydagi <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/-8210570?ONDATE=20.05.2026 00#-8217259">OʻRQ-1146-sonli</a> qonunlari tahririda — Qonunchilik maʼlumotlari milliy bazasi, 27.03.2026-y., 03/26/1124/0277-son; 20.05.2026-y., 03/26/1146/0514-son. OʻRQ-1124 kuchga kirish sanasi — 2026-yil 28-iyun, OʻRQ-1146 kuchga kirish sanasi — 2026-yil 20-may)</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-5516883" id="-5516883"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="-5516885" id="-5516885">“Litsenziyalash, ruxsat berish va xabardor qilish tartib-taomillari toʻgʻrisida”gi Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi <a href="https://lex.uz/uz/docs/5511879">Qonuniga</a><br />3-ILOVA</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="-5516889" id="-5516889">Vakolatli organlarni xabardor qilish tartibida amalga oshiriladigan faoliyat turlari</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-5516891" id="-5516891"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8289325" id="-8289325"></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="-8289326" id="-8289326"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="MsoNormalTable" style="width: 100.0%;border-collapse: collapse;mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184;mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm" width="100%"><tbody><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0;mso-yfti-firstrow: yes"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">T/r</span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: solid solid solid none;border-color: black black black currentcolor;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="24%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Xabarnomaning nomi</span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: solid solid solid none;border-color: black black black currentcolor;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="52%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Xabardor qilish tartibida amalga oshiriladigan faoliyat (harakat) turlari (kichik turlari)</span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: solid solid solid none;border-color: black black black currentcolor;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Xabardor qilish tartib-taomillari sohasidagi vakolatli organlar</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 1"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qimmatbaho metallardan va qimmatbaho toshlardan zargarlik buyumlari hamda boshqa buyumlar ishlab chiqarish faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Shaxsiy buyurtma asosida aholi tomonidan taqdim etilgan materiallardan zargarlik buyumlari ishlab chiqarish va qimmatbaho metallardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlarini taʼmirlash. Oʻz ishlab chiqarishidan hosil boʻlgan chiqindilarni mexanik, kimyoviy va metallurgiya jarayonlarini qoʻllash yordamida qayta ishlash va ularning tarkibidan qimmatbaho metallarni ajratib olish (aholi buyurtmasiga asosan zargarlik buyumlari yasashda hosil boʻlgan chiqindilarni qayta ishlash huquqiga ega emas);</span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Davlat asillik darajasi nazorati inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 2"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">zargarlik buyumlarini ishlab chiqarish. Oʻz ishlab chiqarishidan hosil boʻlgan chiqindilarni mexanik, kimyoviy va metallurgiya jarayonlarini qoʻllash yordamida qayta ishlash va ularning tarkibidan qimmatbaho metallarni ajratib olish (aholi buyurtmasiga asosan zargarlik buyumlari yasashda hosil boʻlgan chiqindilarni qayta ishlash huquqiga ega emas);</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 3"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">yuridik va jismoniy shaxslardan qimmatbaho metallarni, shu jumladan oltin izlovchilar usulida qazib olingan qimmatbaho metallarni, qimmatbaho metallardan va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik hamda boshqa buyumlarni, shuningdek ularning parchalari va chiqindilarini sotib olish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 4"><td rowspan="17" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></p></td><td rowspan="17" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlar bilan ishlashni boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Zargarlik buyumlarini, qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan boshqa buyumlarni, shuningdek qimmatbaho toshlarni baholash;</span></p></td><td rowspan="17" style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Davlat asillik darajasi nazorati inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 5"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlarni baholash, qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlarni gemmologik tekshirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 6"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallardan yasalgan laboratoriya idishlaridan, katalizatorlar, katalizator setkalaridan, tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlar boʻlgan uskunalardan, termopar, termorele, termoqarshilikdan foydalanish va ularni saqlash;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 7"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan tashqi qoplamalar tayyorlash va/yoki surkash (kimyoviy, elektrokimyoviy, purkash va boshqa usullar bilan);</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 8"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan moddalarni (tibbiy preparatlar, tuzlar, reagentlar, kimyoviy birikmalar va boshqalarni) ishlab chiqarish, qoʻllash, saqlash;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 9"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan tish yasashga moʻljallangan mahsulotlar uchun disklar, elektrodlar, anodlar, kontaktlar va kavsharlarni tayyorlash, ulardan foydalanish, ularni saqlash;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 10"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tibbiyot, oziq-ovqat, alkogol va vino-aroq mahsulotlari ishlab chiqarishda qimmatbaho metallardan, tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan oziq-ovqat qoʻshimchalaridan foydalanish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 11"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlarga ishlov berish, ularni sayqallash. Tabiiy olmosdan yasalgan filyerlar, voloklar, olmos uchliklardan, tabiiy olmosdan yasalgan olmos asbobdan va burgʻulash olmos asbobidan foydalanish hamda ularni saqlash. Olmos asbobini rekuperatsiya qilish ishlarini amalga oshirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallarni, qimmatbaho metallardan yasalgan zargarlik va boshqa buyumlarni tahlil qilish hamda ularning asillik darajasini nazorat qilish ishlari;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 13"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan maishiy texnika, tashkiliy texnika, tibbiyot texnikasi va boshqa buyumlarni qismlarga ajratish, ularga dastlabki ishlov berish, turlarga ajratish, bosma platalarni utilizatsiya qilish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 14"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">uzellarida qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlar boʻlgan asbob-uskunalarni qismlarga ajratish hamda utilizatsiya qilish, shuningdek tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan asbob-uskunalarni qismlarga ajratishdan va utilizatsiya qilishdan olingan chiqindilarni qayta ishlash korxonalariga topshirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 15"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan ikkilamchi resurslar, parchalar va chiqindilarni keyinchalik qayta ishlash (affinaj) korxonalariga topshirish uchun toʻplash (tayyorlash), qismlarga ajratish, saralash, ularga dastlabki (birlamchi) qayta ishlov berish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 16"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallardan harbiy va/yoki aviatsiya texnikasini ?aʼmirlashda foydalanish, tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan harbiy va/yoki aviatsiya texnikasi chiqindilarini saqlash va ulardan foydalanish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 17"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">harbiy va/yoki aviatsiya texnikasidan tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan radiodetallar va elementlarni ajratib olish, harbiy va/yoki aviatsiya texnikasining tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan chiqindilarini toʻplash va qayta ishlash korxonalariga topshirish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 18"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlar, qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlar boʻlgan buyumlar hamda predmetlarni koʻrgazmalarga qoʻyish, saqlash va restavratsiya qilish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 19"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlari hamda boshqa buyumlarni, tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlar boʻlgan predmetlarni (davlat organlarining qarorlariga koʻra davlat daromadiga oʻtkazilgan) restavratsiya qilish (taʼmirlash);</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 20"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">tarkibida kumush mavjud boʻlgan va yorugʻlikka taʼsirchan materiallardan, kinofotorentgen-plyonkalar, kinofotorentgen-plastinkalar va tarkibida qimmatbaho metallar boʻlgan xuddi shunday materiallardan foydalanish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 21"><td rowspan="5" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Zargarlik buyumlarini hamda qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan boshqa buyumlarni sotish faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlari va boshqa buyumlar, qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlar bilan chakana savdo qilish (shu jumladan, xorijiy davlatlardan sotish uchun olib kelingan), qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlari va boshqa buyumlar bilan vositachilik savdosi;</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Davlat asillik darajasi nazorati inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 22"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">axborot-kommunikatsiya texnologiyalaridan (onlayn-doʻkonlardan) foydalangan holda qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlari va boshqa buyumlarning chakana savdosi;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 23"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlari va boshqa buyumlar bilan bojsiz savdo zonalarida chakana savdo qilish (duty free);</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 24"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallar, qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlar hamda ulardan yasalgan buyumlarni sotib olish, qimmatbaho metallarning parchalari va chiqindilarini sotib olish;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 25"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qimmatbaho metallar va qimmatbaho toshlardan yasalgan zargarlik buyumlari va boshqa buyumlar, qimmatbaho va yarim qimmatbaho toshlar bilan ulgurji savdo qilish (shu jumladan, xorijiy davlatlardan sotish uchun olib kelingan).</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 26"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">4.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Investitsiya maslahatchisi faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Investitsiya maslahatchisi faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Istiqbolli loyihalar milliy agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 27"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">5.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Lombard faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Lombard faoliyati </span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 28"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">6.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Naqd xorijiy va (yoki) milliy valyutani olib kirganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Banklar tomonidan naqd xorijiy va (yoki) milliy valyutani olib kirish</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 29"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">7.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Bank filiali yoki bank xizmatlari ofisini ochganlik va tugatganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Bank filialini ochish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 30"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">bank xizmatlari ofisini ochish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 31"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">8.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Toʻlov tashkilotini qayta tashkil etish (qoʻshib yuborish, qoʻshib olish, boʻlish, ajratib chiqarish, oʻzgartirish) haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Toʻlov tashkilotini qayta tashkil etish (qoʻshib yuborish, qoʻshib olish, boʻlish, ajratib chiqarish, oʻzgartirish).</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 32"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">9.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Elektron pullar emitentining elektron pullarni chiqarish boʻyicha faoliyatni boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik toʻgʻrisidagi xabarnomasi</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Elektron pullar emitentining elektron pullarni chiqarish boʻyicha faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 33"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">10.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Mikromoliya tashkilotining filialini ochganlik yoki yopganlik haqidagi xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Mikromoliya tashkilotining filialini ochish</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 34"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">10<sup>1</sup>.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Lombardning filialini ochganlik yoki yopganlik haqidagi xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Lombardning filialini ochish</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 35"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">10<sup>2</sup>.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Nobank kredit tashkilotining ustav fondidagi (ustav kapitalidagi) ulush olinganligi toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Jismoniy va yuridik shaxslar, shu jumladan tegishincha yaqin qarindoshlari hamda ularga aloqador boʻlgan shaxslar bilan birgalikda harakat qiluvchi jismoniy va yuridik shaxslar, shuningdek norezidentlar tomonidan bir yoki bir nechta bitim natijasida nobank kredit tashkilotining ustav fondidagi (ustav kapitalidagi) oʻn foizdan yigirma foizgacha tashkil etadigan ulushni bevosita yoki bilvosita olish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 36"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">10<sup>3</sup>.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Faktoring tashkilotining filialini ochganlik yoki yopganlik haqidagi xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 13.55pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Faktoring tashkilotining filialini ochish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Markaziy banki</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 37"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">11.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qoʻshimcha taʼlim faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Nodavlat qoʻshimcha taʼlim (bolalar uchun), shu jumladan chet tillarini oʻrgatish faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Maktabgacha va maktab taʼlimi vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 38"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Nodavlat qoʻshimcha taʼlim (katta yoshdagilar uchun), shu jumladan chet tillarini oʻrgatish faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 39"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">12.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Kadrlar malakasini oshirish va ularni qayta tayyorlash faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Kadrlar malakasini oshirish va ularni qayta tayyorlash faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Oliy taʼlim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 42"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">15.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qoʻriqlash texnik vositalari va tizimlarini montaj qilish, sozlash, taʼmirlash hamda ularga texnik xizmat koʻrsatish faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qoʻriqlash texnik vositalari va tizimlarini montaj qilish, sozlash, taʼmirlash hamda ularga texnik xizmat koʻrsatish faoliyati yoki uning bir qismi.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Ichki ishlar vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 43"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">16.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Avtomototransport vositasi konstruksiyasini va (yoki) uning bir qismini oʻzgartirish bilan bogʻliq faoliyatni boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Avtomototransport vositasi konstruksiyasini va (yoki) uning qismini oʻzgartirish bilan bogʻliq faoliyat.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Ichki ishlar vazirligi Jamoat xavfsizligi departamentining Yoʻl harakati xavfsizligi xizmati</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 44"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">17.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Umumiy ovqatlanish korxonalari va koʻngilochar obyektlarning tungi vaqtda faoliyat yuritishni boshlaganligi yoki tugatganligi toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Umumiy ovqatlanish korxonalarining soat 23.00 dan 06.00 gacha faoliyat yuritishi;</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Tuman va shahar ichki ishlar boshqarmalari (boʻlimlari)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 45"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">koʻngilochar obyektlarning soat 23.00 dan 06.00 gacha faoliyat yuritishi.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 46"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">18.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Avtovokzalning (avtostansiyaning) faoliyatini boshlaganligi yoki tugatganligi haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Avtovokzalning (avtostansiyaning) faoliyatini amalga oshirish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Transport vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 47"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">19.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qurilish-montaj ishlarini boshlaganlik toʻgʻrisida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qurilish-montaj ishlarini olib borish.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qoraqalpogʻiston Respublikasi, viloyatlar hamda Toshkent shahri qurilish va uy-joy kommunal xoʻjaligi sohasida nazorat qilish hududiy inspeksiyalari avtomobil yoʻllari va sunʼiy inshootlar boʻyicha Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Transport vazirligi huzuridagi Transport nazorati inspeksiyasi</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> 19<sup>1</sup>.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Obyektlarning murakkablik toifalari klassifikatori boʻyicha I toifadagi arxitektura-shaharsozlik hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Obyektlarning murakkablik toifalari klassifikatori boʻyicha I toifadagi arxitektura-shaharsozlik hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU"> Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Qurilish va uy-joy kommunal xoʻjaligi vazirligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 48"><td style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">20.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Veterinariya davolash-profilaktika faoliyatini boshlaganlik yoki tugatganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Veterinariya davolash-profilaktika faoliyati.</span></p></td><td style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qoraqalpogʻiston Respublikasi Veterinariya va chorvachilikni rivojlantirish qoʻmitasi, viloyatlar hamda Toshkent shahar veterinariya va chorvachilikni rivojlantirish boshqarmalari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 50"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 5.60224%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black black;border-image: initial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">22.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margi