tial;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">33.</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 23.6695%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Milliy muzey fondi tarkibiga kiritilgan muzey ashyolari va muzey kolleksiyalarini tasarrufdan chiqarish yoki universal huquqiy vorislik tartibida yoxud boshqa usulda bir shaxsdan ikkinchi shaxsga oʻtkazganlik haqida xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Milliy muzey fondi tarkibiga kiritilgan muzey ashyolari va muzey kolleksiyalarini tasarrufdan chiqarish;</span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width: 27.451%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Madaniy meros agentligi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 87"><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor;padding: 0cm 3pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.75pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Milliy muzey fondi tarkibiga kiritilgan muzey ashyolari va muzey kolleksiyalarini universal huquqiy vorislik tartibida yoxud boshqa usulda bir shaxsdan ikkinchi shaxsga oʻtkazish.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 88"><td style="border-width: medium 1pt 1pt;border-style: none solid solid;border-color: currentcolor black windowtext;padding: 0cm;width: 5.60224%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">34.</span></p></td><td style="border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black windowtext currentcolor;padding: 0cm;width: 23.6695%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;margin-left: 3.0pt;text-indent: 14.2pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Nodavlat arxivning faoliyati boshlanganligi yoki tugatilganligi toʻgʻrisidagi xabarnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 43.2773%;border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style: none solid solid none;border-color: currentcolor black windowtext currentcolor;padding: 0c