ack;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;line-height: normal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: EN-US;mso-fareast-language: RU"> Tabiiy gazning ulgurji va chakana savdosi boʻyicha faoliyatni amalga oshirish uchun litsenziya</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: 1pt solid black;border-right: 1pt solid black;padding: 0cm 3pt"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU"> 300</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 58"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">II. Ruxsat etish xususiyatiga ega hujjatsiz faoliyatni (harakatni) amalga oshirganlik yoki ruxsat etish xususiyatiga ega hujjatlarni qalbaki hujjatlardan foydalangan holda olganlik uchun</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 59;height: 3.0pt"><td colspan="2" style="width: 68.36%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" width="68%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ruxsat etish xususiyatiga ega hujjatning (tartib-taomilning) nomi</span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt;height: 3.0pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Jarima miqdori (bazaviy hisoblash miqdorida)</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 60"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;margin-left: 18.0pt;text-align: center;text-indent: -18.0pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">1.</span></p></td><td style="width: 64.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Ogʻir vaznli va katta hajmli yuklarni avtomobil transportida tashishga ruxsatnoma, bundan past va oʻrta faollikdagi radioaktiv chiqindilarni tashish mustasno</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">100</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 61"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;margin-left: 18.0pt;text-align: center;text-indent: -18.0pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">2.</span></p></td><td style="width: 64.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Avtotransport vositasini xavfli yuklarni tashishga qoʻyish toʻgʻrisidagi guvohnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">150</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 62"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;margin-left: 18.0pt;text-align: center;text-indent: -18.0pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">3.</span></p></td><td style="width: 64.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Avtomototransport vositalarini qayta jihozlash uchun ruxsatnoma</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: sol