mily: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Yer osti boyliklari yoki uning qismlarini qazib oluvchi korxonani tugatish va konservatsiya qilishga doir maxsus loyihani kelishish</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">100</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 109"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;margin-left: 18.0pt;text-align: center;text-indent: -18.0pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">51.</span></p></td><td style="width: 64.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Kon ishlarini rivojlantirish rejasini kelishish</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-align: center;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">100</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 110"><td style="width: 3.72%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;margin-left: 18.0pt;text-align: center;text-indent: -18.0pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">52.</span></p></td><td style="width: 64.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="64%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;margin-bottom: 8.25pt;text-indent: 14.3pt;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: black;mso-fareast-language: RU">Foydalanish, tugatish va konservatsiya qilishda neft va gaz quduqlarini oʻtkazish dalolatnomasi hamda shaxtalarni (konlarni) bir toifadan boshqasiga oʻtkazishni tasdiqlash va kelishish toʻgʻrisida xulosa</span></p></td><td style="width: 31.64%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-